@host = https://localhost:7233

### 1. Unos kupca (agent1)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rewards
Content-Type: application/json
X-Agent-Id: 2

{ "customerExternalId": 6, "note": "Loyal customer" }

### 2. Isti kupac, drugi agent
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rewards
Content-Type: application/json
X-Agent-Id: 3

{ "customerExternalId": 1 }

### 3. Nepostojeći kupac
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rewards
Content-Type: application/json
X-Agent-Id: 2

{ "customerExternalId": 99999 }

### 4. Admin pokušava unos
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rewards
Content-Type: application/json
X-Agent-Id: 1

{ "customerExternalId": 2 }

### 5. Moji današnji unosi (agent1)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rewards/my
X-Agent-Id: 2

### 6. Agent2 poništava tuđi unos
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/rewards/1
X-Agent-Id: 3

### 7. Agent1 poništava svoj unos 
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/rewards/1
X-Agent-Id: 2

### 8. Lista svih aktivnih (admin/eksterni sistem)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rewards?page=1&pageSize=20

### 9. Dobavljanje jednog klijenta
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers/1
